  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Create reality class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may create an illusion around a creature that gives the appearance and feeling that the creature is in good health. This illusion works not only on the creature, but on anyone observing the creature. Whenever the creature takes damage from any source, the amount of damage taken is reduced by half your caster level (minimum 0). Unlike damage reduction, this can not be bypassed, except if the attacker manages to disbelieve the illusion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/fey-adept#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
